# Firebase Configuration Values (Fill These In)
#
# After completing FIREBASE_SETUP_STEP1.md, fill in these values from the Firebase Console.
# Then use these to populate your .env.local and CI/CD secrets.
#
# ⚠️ NEVER COMMIT THIS FILE — it contains sensitive project IDs and API keys.
# Store this locally only (not in git).

# ============================================================================
# STAGING PROJECT
# ============================================================================

